{"3580060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Karma and Jonar - The Rock Trolls", "steam_appid": 3580060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580060/extras/5f1a1708970be1443b5e9d8934d7411c.webp?t=1788089183\" width=342 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a magical adventure in Karma &amp; Jonar – The Rock Trolls, a fantasy co-op  game where you and a friend take on the roles of the brave children Karma and Jonar. Despite their families being sworn enemies, they must work together to save the land of Glimeria from the forces of darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580060/extras/8b138e565a5f2b7c222607fa624eb5e1.avif?t=1788089183\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580060/extras_big/8b138e565a5f2b7c222607fa624eb5e1.avif?t=1788089183 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580060/extras/1aca567186fca2ca4e45237da74ec053.webp?t=1788089183\" width=166 height=31 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COOP</strong>: work together to save <i>Glimeria</i> from the Rock trolls (features remote play together).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome</strong> challenges, in split screen and 2.5D-view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience</strong> a deep story around <strong>bravery</strong> and <strong>friendship.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the magical world <i>Glimeria</i> and discover its diversity of animals and plants.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580060/extras/3f663bbfaf9a9c9ac8e264a848d39fb3.avif?t=1788089183\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580060/extras_big/3f663bbfaf9a9c9ac8e264a848d39fb3.avif?t=1788089183 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580060/extras/dc2be03f11124bc194baeea952c60db6.webp?t=1788089183\" width=240 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is based on the popular children's book series, which has sold over 200,000 copies in the Nordic region and has also been adapted into an animated TV series. Now, you can experience this beloved universe in an interactive adventure that emphasizes friendship, courage, and the ability to overcome differences to fight evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your strength and embark on an unforgettable journey in Karma &amp; Jonar – The Rock Trolls, where teamwork is the key to saving Glimeria!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580060/extras/681be25fd43930a14434eb46018add5a.avif?t=1788089183\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580060/extras_big/681be25fd43930a14434eb46018add5a.webp?t=1788089183 width=1560 height=889 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steams